domain CompactReplayHandoff:
  description "Preserve approved work for tomorrow"
problem P1:
  "The owner deferred provider replay to tomorrow and requested handoff, WIP commit and push."
evidence E1:
  |
    Current matching worktree is monotony-log-rca-kshiai on codex/monotony-log-rca
    at f1ff97735e7bfd42be4c21a0e421bec334052005. No paid request was sent.
    Only an old untracked v2 review input and this turn's replay reasoning are
    untracked. GitHub has no matching branch ref. Main is 1cdf210.
evidence E2:
  |
    The older v2 input proposes lifecycle IDs prohibited by accepted v3.
    It is historical WIP, not the accepted requirement. Preserving it with an
    explicit historical banner avoids both data loss and authority confusion.
    Main checkout has separate unrelated edits; they are outside this handoff.
evidence E3:
  |
    Main repository secdat GH_TOKEN secret injection dry-run succeeded.
    HTTPS remote is https://github.com/mako10k/kshiai.git. No Git credential
    helper was returned by local config inspection. gh authenticated API reads
    succeeded under the required injection route.
decision D1 based_on P1, E1, E2, E3:
  |
    Stop paid replay preparations after a truthful handoff record. Retain the
    preliminary replay reasoning, label historical v2 WIP as non-normative,
    document exact commits, verification limits, pending harness and resume
    point. Make one WIP documentation commit and non-force push this exact
    branch via secdat. Use a command-scoped gh credential helper for this
    authorized push without changing persistent Git config. Verify server
    branch SHA equals local HEAD and inspect remaining local changes.
    Do not end the shared workday because the instruction targets this task.
